                                                    "name": "Complete Blood Count (CBC)",
                                                    "description": "<p>Complete Blood Count evaluates overall blood health.</p><p>It measures RBC, WBC, hemoglobin, and platelets.</p><p>It helps diagnose infections and anemia.</p><p>It is one of the most common lab tests.</p><p>It provides a broad health overview.</p><p>It helps detect abnormalities early.</p><p>It is useful in routine checkups.</p><p>It supports diagnosis and treatment planning.</p><p>It is widely used in clinical practice.</p><p>It requires a simple blood sample.</p><p>It helps monitor chronic diseases.</p><p>It is essential for medical evaluation.</p>",
