                                                    "precaution": "<h2>Collection Instructions (Very Important)</h2><ol><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>The lab will provide a large collection container.</li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Day 1 (Morning):</strong></li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Empty bladder and discard the first urine.</li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>After that, collect <strong>all urine for the next 24 hours</strong>.</li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Day 2 (Same time next morning):</strong></li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Collect the final urine sample.</li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Keep the container tightly closed.</li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Store in a cool place or refrigerator during collection.</li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Submit to the lab immediately after completion.</li></ol><p>Missing even one sample can affect accuracy.</p><h2>Normal Range</h2><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><strong>Less than 150 mg per 24 hours</strong> (Normal)</li></ol><p>Higher values may indicate kidney problems.</p><h2><br></h2><h2>Precautions</h2><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Do not skip any urine sample.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Avoid contamination (no stool or tissue paper).</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Keep the container clean and refrigerated if advised.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Inform lab if any sample was missed.</li></ol>",
                                                    "sideeffects": null,
                                                    "complexity": null,
                                                    "duration": "",
                                                    "testtype": null,
                                                    "smapletype": "Blood",
                                                    "isFasting": "no",
                                                    "normalrange": null,
