                                                    "iscontrast": null,
                                                    "procedureType": null,
                                                    "recoveryTime": null,
                                                    "preparationInstructions": "<h2><br></h2><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>No fasting required</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Continue regular diet unless instructed otherwise</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Avoid heavy exercise before and during collection</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Inform doctor about medications (some may affect results)</li></ol>",
