                                                    "_id": "69b7c89e3da6810c9f83c36f",
                                                    "name": "Vitamin B12 (Serum Vitamin B12 - B12)",
                                                    "description": "<p>Vitamin B12 Test measures the level of vitamin B12 in the blood.</p><p>It is essential for nerve function and red blood cell production.</p><p>Low levels may cause anemia and neurological issues.</p><p>It helps diagnose vitamin deficiency conditions.</p><p>Common symptoms include fatigue, weakness, and numbness.</p><p>The test is widely used in routine health checkups.</p><p>It is important for vegetarians and elderly individuals.</p><p>Requires a blood sample for analysis.</p><p>Helps monitor treatment response for deficiency.</p><p>Plays a role in brain and nerve health evaluation.</p><p>Provides important nutritional insights.</p>",
