                                                    "diagnostictype": null,
                                                    "bodypart": null,
                                                    "iscontrast": null,
                                                    "procedureType": null,
                                                    "recoveryTime": null,
                                                    "preparationInstructions": "<p>Maintain normal diet prior to testing unless clinician specifies fasting requirement. Avoid alcohol consumption 24 hours before sample collection for accurate results. Refrain from heavy physical activity prior to blood draw to stabilize glucose levels. Inform laboratory about ongoing antidiabetic medications or insulin therapy. Ensure adequate hydration before venipuncture unless medically restricted. Avoid smoking immediately before sample collection as it may influence metabolic parameters. Follow physician guidance regarding medication timing on test day. Schedule sample collection preferably in morning for standardized interpretation. Wear comfortable clothing to facilitate easy venous access. Provide accurate clinical history including family history of diabetes mellitus.</p>",
