                                                    "strength": null,
                                                    "directionofuse": null,
                                                    "precaution": "<p>Inform the doctor about any ongoing medical conditions or recent treatments before the procedure. Follow all instructions provided by the healthcare team carefully. Avoid unnecessary movement during the scan to ensure accurate imaging results. Remain calm and relaxed throughout the procedure. Notify the technician if you feel discomfort at any stage. Inform about any allergies or sensitivities prior to the test. Ensure proper communication with the medical staff during the procedure. Do not ignore any unusual symptoms experienced during or after the test. Follow all safety guidelines provided at the diagnostic center. Adhere strictly to medical advice given by the doctor. Maintain a cooperative posture for accurate imaging.</p>",
                                                    "sideeffects": "<p>Bone Scan is generally safe with minimal side effects. Mild discomfort may occur at the injection site where the tracer is administered. Some patients may notice slight redness or swelling at the injection area. Allergic reactions to the tracer are rare but possible. The amount of radiation exposure is minimal and considered safe for diagnostic purposes. Temporary discomfort during the scanning process may occur due to prolonged positioning. The radioactive tracer naturally leaves the body over time without causing harm. Mild fatigue may be experienced in some cases. There are no long-term complications associated with this test. Most patients tolerate the procedure well without any issues. Medical attention is rarely required after the scan.</p>",
                                                    "complexity": null,
                                                    "duration": null,
                                                    "testtype": null,
                                                    "smapletype": null,
                                                    "isFasting": null,
                                                    "normalrange": null,
