                                                    "_id": "698ec84ad3ad0b2471e5220b",
                                                    "name": "6-Channel ECG Machine",
                                                    "description": "<p>The 6-Channel ECG Machine is an advanced cardiac diagnostic device designed to record and analyze the electrical activity of the heart through multiple simultaneous ECG leads for accurate cardiovascular assessment. This electrocardiograph system is widely used in hospitals, clinics, diagnostic centers, emergency care units, ambulances, and healthcare facilities for routine cardiac monitoring and diagnostic evaluation.</p><p><br></p><p>The machine captures real-time cardiac electrical signals and produces detailed ECG waveforms that help healthcare professionals identify arrhythmias, ischemic changes, myocardial abnormalities, conduction disorders, and other cardiovascular conditions. The 6-channel recording capability allows simultaneous multi-lead ECG printing and display for efficient cardiac analysis and clinical interpretation.</p><p><br></p><p>Manufactured using advanced medical-grade ECG technology, the 6-Channel ECG Machine features high-resolution displays, waveform visualization, automatic interpretation functions, digital storage, built-in thermal printers, and user-friendly controls for efficient operation and patient management. Many models also support rechargeable batteries, USB connectivity, data transfer functions, and network integration for enhanced workflow and report management.</p><p><br></p><p>The ergonomic and compact design allows convenient use in outpatient departments, bedside monitoring, emergency care, ambulatory services, and diagnostic laboratories. The device supports quick ECG acquisition and reliable cardiac assessment while improving workflow efficiency and patient care in clinical environments.</p><p><br></p><p>The 6-Channel ECG Machine is widely used for routine heart examinations, emergency cardiac assessment, health screenings, pre-operative evaluation, and cardiovascular monitoring. It is designed to provide accurate ECG recording, reliable cardiac diagnostics, efficient clinical performance, patient convenience, and dependable cardiovascular healthcare support for hospitals and healthcare professionals.</p>",
