                                                    "_id": "698ec926d3ad0b2471e522f3",
                                                    "name": "12-Channel ECG Machine",
                                                    "description": "<p>electrical activity of the heart through twelve simultaneous leads for comprehensive cardiovascular assessment. This electrocardiograph system is widely used in hospitals, cardiology departments, clinics, diagnostic centers, emergency care units, ambulances, and healthcare facilities for accurate heart monitoring and cardiac diagnosis.</p><p><br></p><p>The machine captures real-time cardiac electrical signals and generates detailed ECG waveforms to help healthcare professionals identify arrhythmias, myocardial infarction, conduction abnormalities, ischemic changes, and other cardiovascular conditions. Simultaneous 12-lead recording provides a complete view of heart activity for improved diagnostic accuracy and clinical evaluation.</p><p><br></p><p>Manufactured using advanced medical-grade ECG technology, the 12-Channel ECG Machine features high-resolution displays, waveform visualization, automatic interpretation functions, digital data storage, built-in printers, touchscreen interfaces, and connectivity options for efficient clinical workflow and patient record management. Many models also include rechargeable battery systems, USB connectivity, network integration, and advanced analysis software for enhanced cardiac assessment.</p><p><br></p><p>The ergonomic and portable design allows convenient use in bedside monitoring, outpatient departments, emergency rooms, ambulances, and diagnostic laboratories. The device supports rapid ECG acquisition and efficient cardiac screening while improving workflow efficiency and patient care management in clinical environments.</p><p><br></p><p>The 12-Channel ECG Machine is widely used for routine cardiac evaluation, emergency cardiac assessment, pre-operative examinations, health screenings, and cardiovascular monitoring. It is designed to provide accurate ECG recording, reliable cardiac diagnostics, real-time heart monitoring, patient convenience, and dependable clinical performance for comprehensive cardiovascular healthcare applications.</p>",
