                                                    "precaution": "<h2><br></h2><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Ensure proper cuff size and positioning for accurate readings</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Avoid movement or talking during blood pressure measurement</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Do not overtighten the cuff around the arm or wrist</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Avoid measuring immediately after exercise or heavy meals</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Keep the monitor away from water, excessive heat, and moisture</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Replace damaged cuffs or accessories immediately</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Consult healthcare professionals for abnormal or inconsistent readings</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Use only approved batteries and accessories</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Handle the monitor carefully to avoid impact damage</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Keep away from strong electromagnetic interference sources</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Follow regular calibration and maintenance recommendations</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Use according to manufacturer and medical guidelines regularly</li></ol><h4><br></h4>",
                                                    "sideeffects": "<h2><br></h2><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Ensure the cuff is properly positioned before starting measurement</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Keep the body relaxed during monitoring for accurate results</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Inspect the cuff and monitor regularly for damage or wear</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Clean and disinfect the device according to hygiene guidelines</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Avoid dropping or exposing the monitor to physical impact</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Monitor battery status regularly for uninterrupted operation</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Use the device only for intended blood pressure monitoring purposes</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Keep the monitor away from children when not in use</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Do not attempt unauthorized repairs or modifications</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Store the monitor safely away from moisture and dust</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Use under healthcare supervision when required</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Follow manufacturer safety and maintenance instructions carefully</li></ol><h4><br></h4>",
