                                                    "directionofuse": null,
                                                    "precaution": "<ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Avoid colored foods and beverages for 24–48 hours</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Minimize consumption of coffee, tea, red wine, and soft drinks</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Avoid smoking or tobacco products after treatment</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Maintain regular brushing and flossing routine</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Use a soft-bristled toothbrush for gentle cleaning</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Follow dentist-recommended oral hygiene practices</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Drink plenty of water to help maintain oral cleanliness</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Avoid extremely hot or cold foods if temporary sensitivity occurs</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Use dentist-recommended toothpaste for sensitive teeth if needed</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Attend follow-up dental checkups when advised</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Maintain regular professional dental cleaning appointments</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Avoid staining foods immediately after whitening treatment</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Follow all post-procedure instructions provided by the dental professional</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Results may vary depending on lifestyle and oral hygiene habits</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Proper aftercare helps maintain whitening results for a longer duration</li></ol>",
                                                    "sideeffects": "<ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Temporary tooth sensitivity may occur after treatment</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Mild gum or soft tissue irritation in some cases</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Temporary discomfort with hot or cold foods and beverages</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Uneven whitening results may occur depending on existing stains</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Mild enamel dehydration immediately after the procedure</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Short-term tooth sensitivity to air exposure</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Whitening results may vary between individuals</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Existing dental restorations may not whiten uniformly</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Temporary gum whitening or irritation from whitening gel contact</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Minor tingling sensation during or after treatment</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Overuse of whitening procedures may affect enamel appearance</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Patients with sensitive teeth may experience temporary discomfort</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Rare cases of prolonged sensitivity may require dental consultation</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Improper aftercare may reduce whitening longevity</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Professional dental supervision is recommended for safe treatment outcomes</li></ol>",
