                                                    "recoveryTime": null,
                                                    "preparationInstructions": "<p>Tooth preparation is performed for crown placement. Impression is taken or chairside fabrication is done. Acrylic material is shaped to form crown. Crown is trimmed and polished for fit. Occlusion is checked and adjusted. Temporary cement is used to place crown. Excess cement is removed. Patient comfort is assessed. Instructions are provided for care. Follow-up visit is scheduled for permanent crown placement.</p>",
