                                                    "name": "Zandu Vigorex Gold Capsule | Manages Stress & Builds Energy & Stamina",
                                                    "description": "Zandu Vigorex Gold Capsule contains eight ayurvedic ingredients known to manage stress, build stamina, improve endurance, and boost energy. It shows an aphrodisiac, an adaptogen and antioxidant activity.Key IngredientsExtract of Withania Somnifera Dunal (Ashwagandha), Mucuna Prurita Hook (Kaunch Beej), Asparagus Racemosus Willd (Shatavari), Asparagus Adscendens Roxb (Safed Musli), Tribulus Terrestris Linn (Gokshur), Shudh Shilajit, Powders of Myristica fragrans Houtt, Anacyclus Pyrethrum DCS, Syzygium Aromaticum Linn, Yashad Bhasma, Moti Pishti, Crocus, Sativus Linn, Swarna Bhasma, Excipients Q. S, ColouringIndications \r\n\r\nManages stress\r\n\r\n\r\nBoosts stamina and energy\r\n\r\nProduct Form:Capsule.Key Benefits:\r\n\r\nThis vegetarian capsule is enriched with minerals, which helps to increase both strength and stamina\r\n\r\n\r\nRegular consumption helps avoid stress in day-to-day life\r\n\r\n\r\nRelieves aches and pains and works by increasing the level of a natural substance in the brain\r\n\r\n\r\nThe capsule acts by boosting your immune system\r\n\r\n\r\nThis ayurvedic vitaliser is a scientifically proven natural and safe capsule\r\n\r\n\r\nIt contains ashwagandha, which helps manage stress, and safed musli aids in rejuvenation\r\n\r\n\r\nKaunch beej helps provide vigour, and shatavari aids in providing vitality\r\n\r\n\r\nShilajit aids in providing strength, and gokshur helps provide stamina\r\n\r\n\r\nYasad bhasma helps reduce lethargy, and gold bhasma helps provide power\r\n\r\nDosageOne capsule twice a day, preferably with milk or as directed by the physician.Safety Information\r\n\r\nReplace the cap tightly after every use\r\n\r\n\r\nIt is best avoided in pregnancy, lactation and children\r\n\r\n\r\nRead the label carefully before use\r\n\r\n\r\nStore in a cool and dry place, away from sunlight\r\n\r\n\r\nKeep out of reach of children\r\n\r\n\r\nDon't exceed the recommended dosage\r\n\r\n\r\nUse under medical supervision\r\n\r\n\r\nAvoid any strong smell in the mouth, such as coffee, onion, hing, mint, camphor, garlic etc., while taking medicine\r\n\r\n\r\nAvoid eating tobacco or drinking alcohol during the course",
