                                                    "name": "Cobadex Czs Tablet | with Essential Vitamins | Nutritional Supplement",
                                                    "description": "<p>In Vitamin &amp; mineral deficiency Cobadex Czs Tablet | with Essential Vitamins | Nutritional Supplement contains nutritional supplements that help the body perform various vital functions like formation of red blood cells and absorption of iron in the body. It also helps your body use fats and carbohydrates for energy and make new protein. This combination contains other vitamins and minerals that help in strengthening the immune system, improve metabolism of the body and aid in the proper functioning of the nervous system. It improves overall general health and enhances the quality of life. Cobadex Czs Tablet | with Essential Vitamins | Nutritional Supplement is a nutritional supplement. This medicine is used to treat mineral and vitamin deficiency in the body. It is usually taken when your diet alone cannot provide the necessary supplements your body needs. It fulfills the deficiency and prevents related diseases caused by the deficiencies. Cobadex Czs Tablet | with Essential Vitamins | Nutritional Supplement may be taken with or without food. Take it in the dose and duration advised by the doctor. Take it regularly at the same time each day to get maximum benefits from it. This medicine may be only part of a complete program of treatment that also includes making changes to your diet. Learn about the foods you should eat to make sure you get enough vitamins and minerals in your diet.It is generally safe medicine without any side effects when used within the recommended dose. However, if you experience any symptoms which you think are caused by the medicine, let your doctor know. They may be able to suggest ways to treat or prevent the side effects.Avoid taking Cobadex Czs Tablet | with Essential Vitamins | Nutritional Supplement if you have a known history of allergic reaction to any of the ingredients of this medicine. To make sure it is safe for you, let your doctor know about all the other medicines you are taking. Pregnant and breastfeeding women should inform their doctor before taking this medicine. How to Use: Take this medicine in the dose and duration as advised by your doctor. Swallow it as a whole. Do not chew, crush or break it. Cobadex Czs Tablet | with Essential Vitamins | Nutritional Supplement may be taken with or without food, but it is better to take it at a fixed time. Safety Advice: - Alcohol : CAUTION</p><p>Caution is advised when consuming alcohol with Cobadex Czs Tablet | with Essential Vitamins | Nutritional Supplement. Please consult your doctor. | - Pregnancy : CONSULT YOUR DOCTOR</p><p>Cobadex Czs Tablet | with Essential Vitamin If Missed: If you miss a dose of Cobadex Czs Tablet | with Essential Vitamins | Nutritional Supplement, take it as soon as possible. However, if it is almost time for your next dose, skip the missed dose and go back to your regular schedule. Do not double the dose.</p>",
