                                                    "name": "3-Channel ECG Machine",
                                                    "description": "<p>The 3-Channel ECG Machine is a compact and efficient cardiac diagnostic device designed to record and analyze the electrical activity of the heart through multiple ECG leads for routine cardiovascular assessment and patient monitoring. This electrocardiograph system is widely used in hospitals, clinics, diagnostic centers, physician practices, ambulances, and healthcare facilities for accurate heart monitoring and cardiac evaluation.</p><p><br></p><p>The machine captures real-time cardiac electrical signals and generates ECG waveforms that help healthcare professionals identify arrhythmias, heart rhythm abnormalities, ischemic changes, conduction disorders, and other cardiovascular conditions. The 3-channel recording capability allows simultaneous multi-lead ECG printing and display for efficient cardiac assessment and clinical interpretation.</p><p><br></p><p>Manufactured using advanced medical-grade ECG technology, the 3-Channel ECG Machine features high-resolution displays, waveform visualization, automatic interpretation functions, built-in thermal printers, digital storage, and user-friendly controls for reliable operation and efficient patient management. Many models also support rechargeable battery systems, USB connectivity, portable operation, and data transfer capabilities for improved workflow and clinical convenience.</p><p><br></p><p>The lightweight and ergonomic design allows convenient use in outpatient clinics, bedside monitoring, emergency care units, ambulances, diagnostic laboratories, and mobile healthcare services. The device supports rapid ECG acquisition and dependable cardiac monitoring while improving workflow efficiency and patient care in routine and emergency clinical environments.</p><p><br></p><p>The 3-Channel ECG Machine is widely used for routine cardiac examinations, emergency heart assessment, health screenings, pre-operative evaluations, and cardiovascular monitoring. It is designed to provide accurate ECG recording, reliable cardiac diagnostics, portable clinical performance, patient convenience, and dependable cardiovascular healthcare support for healthcare professionals and medical institutions.</p>",
