                                                    "_id": "69a6779189e508cd55fe1cba",
                                                    "name": "ECG & Heart Rate Monitor",
                                                    "description": "<h4>The ECG &amp; Heart Rate Monitor is an advanced medical monitoring device designed to measure, record, and monitor electrical heart activity and pulse rate for cardiovascular assessment and patient monitoring. This device helps healthcare professionals and users evaluate heart rhythm, heart rate patterns, and overall cardiac health during routine examinations, emergency care, fitness monitoring, and long-term cardiovascular management.</h4><h4><br></h4><h4>Using advanced electrocardiogram (ECG) technology, the monitor records electrical signals generated by the heart to help identify irregular heart rhythms, arrhythmias, abnormal cardiac activity, and other cardiovascular conditions. The integrated heart rate monitoring function provides real-time pulse rate readings for continuous cardiac observation and health assessment.</h4><h4><br></h4><h4>Manufactured using high-quality medical-grade components, the ECG &amp; Heart Rate Monitor offers accurate measurement performance, user-friendly operation, and dependable monitoring capabilities. Many models feature digital displays, waveform visualization, automatic analysis functions, data storage, wireless connectivity, rechargeable batteries, alarm systems, and portable designs for improved monitoring convenience and clinical efficiency.</h4><h4><br></h4><h4>The compact and ergonomic structure makes the device suitable for hospitals, clinics, emergency care units, diagnostic centers, ambulatory monitoring, fitness applications, and home healthcare environments. It supports continuous or spot-check cardiac monitoring for preventive healthcare, rehabilitation, fitness tracking, and cardiovascular disease management.</h4><h4><br></h4><h4>The ECG &amp; Heart Rate Monitor is widely used in hospitals, cardiology departments, clinics, diagnostic laboratories, emergency medical services, rehabilitation centers, and homecare settings. It is designed to provide accurate cardiac monitoring, reliable ECG recording, real-time heart rate assessment, patient convenience, and dependable cardiovascular healthcare support for clinical and personal monitoring applications.</h4>",
