                                                    "precaution": "<ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Ensure all folding sections are properly locked before use</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Avoid using the product on slippery or uneven surfaces</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Check the rubber tip regularly for wear and tear</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Do not use the walking stick if any part is loose or damaged</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Maintain proper balance while using the walking aid</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Avoid exceeding the recommended support capacity</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Keep the product away from excessive moisture and water</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Replace damaged or worn-out components immediately</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Inspect the walking stick regularly for safe operation</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Store the product in a clean and dry environment</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Use the walking stick only for mobility assistance purposes</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Follow maintenance and safety guidelines regularly</li></ol><p><br></p>",
                                                    "sideeffects": "<ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Ensure the walking stick is fully unfolded and locked before use</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Maintain a firm grip while walking for better balance and support</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Use only on stable and non-slippery surfaces</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Inspect the rubber tip regularly for proper traction and stability</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Check the walking stick for loose parts or damage before use</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Replace worn-out rubber tips immediately for safe usage</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Avoid sudden movements or excessive pressure on the walking stick</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Keep the product clean and dry for safe handling</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Store the walking stick safely away from moisture and heat</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Use under supervision if required for elderly or weak users</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Do not modify or alter the structure of the walking stick</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Follow manufacturer safety instructions and maintenance guidelines carefully</li></ol><p><br></p>",
