                                                    "_id": "6a031fdcaa895c1e3186b346",
                                                    "name": "Walker With Wheels",
                                                    "description": "<p>The Walker With Wheels is a specially designed mobility support aid that provides enhanced walking assistance, stability, and smooth movement for elderly individuals, patients recovering from surgery or injury, and users with limited mobility or balance difficulties. Equipped with front or full wheels for easier maneuverability, this walker helps users move comfortably with reduced physical effort compared to standard walkers. It is widely used in hospitals, rehabilitation centers, physiotherapy clinics, nursing homes, and home healthcare environments to support safe and independent mobility during recovery and daily activities. Manufactured using high-quality aluminum or durable metal construction, the walker with wheels is designed to offer excellent strength, lightweight handling, and long-lasting performance. The sturdy frame structure provides dependable support and balanced weight distribution while helping reduce strain on the lower limbs. Ergonomic hand grips ensure comfortable handling and improved control during walking, minimizing hand fatigue during prolonged use. Many models also feature foldable designs for easy storage, portability, and travel convenience. The smooth-rolling wheels allow users to move the walker forward more easily without lifting it completely, improving mobility efficiency and reducing user fatigue. The anti-slip rubber ferrules or rear tips provide additional traction and stability during walking. Adjustable height settings available in selected models allow customization according to the users height and posture, promoting safe movement and proper body alignment. Some advanced models may also include locking wheel systems, padded grips, storage baskets, or seating support for added convenience and functionality. The Walker With Wheels is highly beneficial for senior citizens, orthopedic recovery patients, arthritis patients, individuals with muscle weakness, neurological disorder patients, and users recovering from fractures, surgeries, or mobility-related conditions. It supports safer rehabilitation, improved balance, and increased independence while minimizing the risk of falls and physical strain during movement. Designed for comfort, safety, durability, and ease of use, the Walker With Wheels is an essential healthcare mobility aid suitable for both medical and personal home care use. Its lightweight wheeled design, reliable support structure, and user-friendly functionality make it a preferred choice among patients, caregivers, and healthcare professionals. Suitable for indoor and outdoor use, the walker with wheels enhances mobility confidence, walking comfort, and overall quality of life for individuals requiring dependable walking assistance.</p>",
