                                                    "_id": "6a0592e19136efed5928e706",
                                                    "name": "Wheelchair Stretcher",
                                                    "description": "<p>The Wheelchair Stretcher is an advanced patient mobility and transportation solution designed to combine the functionality of a wheelchair and a stretcher into a single versatile medical device. It is specially developed to provide safe, comfortable, and efficient patient transfer for individuals with limited mobility, critically ill patients, post-surgical patients, trauma patients, and elderly individuals requiring assisted transportation. Widely used in hospitals, emergency rooms, ICUs, ambulances, rehabilitation centers, nursing homes, and healthcare facilities, the wheelchair stretcher enhances patient handling convenience while improving mobility support for caregivers and healthcare professionals. Manufactured using high-quality stainless steel, aluminum alloy, or durable powder-coated metal materials, the wheelchair stretcher is engineered for superior strength, stability, corrosion resistance, and long-lasting performance. The sturdy frame construction supports safe patient transportation while maintaining smooth maneuverability across medical environments. The ergonomic design includes a comfortable cushioned seat and stretcher platform that can be adjusted or converted according to patient requirements, ensuring maximum comfort during sitting, reclining, or lying positions. The wheelchair stretcher is equipped with smooth-rolling caster wheels and secure locking brake systems that provide excellent mobility control and patient safety during transportation. Many models feature adjustable reclining backrests, detachable footrests, foldable side rails, hydraulic height adjustment systems, safety belts, IV pole holders, oxygen cylinder holders, and foldable structures for enhanced convenience and clinical functionality. The convertible design allows healthcare staff to easily transition patients between seated and stretcher positions without requiring multiple transfer devices, thereby reducing physical strain and improving operational efficiency. The wheelchair stretcher is highly beneficial for emergency medical transportation, ICU patient transfer, trauma care, rehabilitation support, post-operative recovery, and long-distance patient movement within healthcare facilities. It helps minimize patient discomfort, reduces transfer-related injury risks, and supports safer patient positioning during medical procedures and transportation. The integrated safety features and ergonomic design make it particularly suitable for critically ill, elderly, disabled, or mobility-restricted patients requiring continuous support. Designed for comfort, safety, durability, and multifunctional patient care, the wheelchair stretcher is an essential healthcare transport and mobility solution for modern medical institutions. Its advanced convertible functionality, smooth mobility, and reliable construction make it a preferred choice among hospitals, ambulance services, caregivers, and healthcare professionals. Suitable for both emergency and routine patient transportation, the wheelchair stretcher significantly enhances patient care quality, transportation efficiency, and overall healthcare support operations.</p>",
