                                                    "_id": "69856559f0fcca21b092e866",
                                                    "name": "Geomax D3 Softgel for Osteoporosis",
                                                    "description": "In Treatment of Nutritional deficiencies Geomax D3 Softgel for Osteoporosis contains nutritional supplements that help the body perform vital functions, like forming red blood cells and absorbing iron. It also helps your body use fats and carbohydrates for energy and make new proteins. This combination contains other vitamins and minerals that help strengthen the immune system, improve the body's metabolism, and aid in the proper functioning of the nervous system. Taking Geomax D3 Softgel for Osteoporosis improves general health and enhances the quality of life.\n\n              Geomax D3 Softgel for Osteoporosis is a combination of vitamins and mineral supplements prescribed to treat vitamin and other nutritional deficiencies. It ensures the proper growth and functioning of the body and strengthens immunity. Geomax D3 Softgel for Osteoporosis may be taken with or without food. It should be used in the dose and duration prescribed by your doctor. It is advised to take this medicine at a fixed time to avoid missing a dose.Geomax D3 Softgel for Osteoporosis is usually a safe medicine with very minimal or no side effects. However, if you experience severe diarrhea, vomiting, or constipation, consult your doctor without delay.Before taking this medicine, tell your doctor if you have other health conditions. Inform your doctor if you are taking other medicines or are pregnant or breastfeeding. It is advised not to take alcohol after taking this medicine.\n\n              How to Use:\n              Take this medicine in the dose and duration as advised by your doctor. Swallow it as a whole. Do not chew, crush or break it. Geomax D3 Softgel for Osteoporosis may be taken with or without food, but it is better to take it at a fixed time.\n\n              Safety Advice:\n              - Alcohol : CONSULT YOUR DOCTOR <p> It is not known whether it is safe to consume alcohol with Geomax D3 Softgel for Osteoporosis. Please consult your doctor. | - Pregnancy : CONSULT YOUR DOCTOR <p> Information regarding the use of Geomax D3 Softgel for O\n\n              If Missed:\n              If you miss a dose of Geomax D3 Softgel for Osteoporosis, take it as soon as possible. However, if it is almost time for your next dose, skip the missed dose and go back to your regular schedule. Do not double the dose.",
