                                                    "description": "Electral - Z+ ORS + Zinc Solution Ready to Drink Liquid Delicious Orange is an oral rehydration salt formula containing a combination of dextrose and essential electrolytes like sodium chloride, potassium chloride, and sodium chloride. Anhydrous dextrose or glucose is ORS primary ingredient, which facilitates sodium and water absorption in the small intestine. The electrolyte liquid helps restore body fluids and electrolytes which get lost due to dehydration caused by diarrhoea, vomiting, muscle cramping, and heat during exercising or hot weather.",
