                                                    "_id": "698edb28d3ad0b2471e540e4",
                                                    "name": "Tricuspid Valve Repair",
                                                    "description": "<h2><br></h2><h2><strong>Tricuspid Valve Repair</strong> is a cardiac surgical procedure performed to correct a damaged or leaking tricuspid valve without replacing it.</h2><p>The tricuspid valve regulates blood flow between the <strong>right atrium and right ventricle</strong>. When it fails to close properly (tricuspid regurgitation) or becomes narrowed (tricuspid stenosis), it can cause fluid buildup, swelling, fatigue, and heart enlargement.</p><p>Repairing the valve helps restore proper blood flow and improves heart function while preserving the patient’s natural valve.</p><h2>Why It Is Needed</h2><p>Doctors may recommend tricuspid valve repair in cases of:</p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Severe tricuspid regurgitation</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Right-sided heart failure</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Valve damage due to infection (endocarditis)</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Congenital heart defects</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Valve dysfunction secondary to left-sided heart disease</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Symptoms such as:</li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Leg swelling</li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Abdominal swelling</li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Breathlessness</li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Fatigue</li></ol><h2>Types of Tricuspid Valve Repair</h2><h3>🔹 Annuloplasty</h3><p>Tightening or reinforcing the valve ring using a surgical ring.</p><h3>🔹 Leaflet Repair</h3><p>Reshaping or repairing damaged valve flaps.</p><h3>🔹 Chordal Repair</h3><p>Fixing supporting tissues of the valve.</p><h3>🔹 Minimally Invasive Repair</h3><p>Performed through smaller incisions for faster recovery.</p>",
