                                                    "form": null,
                                                    "strength": null,
                                                    "directionofuse": "<h2>Post-Procedure Care (Post-Care)</h2><h3>Immediately After Surgery:</h3><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>ICU monitoring (1–2 days)</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Heart rhythm observation</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Pain management</li></ol><h3>At Home:</h3><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Avoid heavy lifting for 4–6 weeks</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Take prescribed medications</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Follow low-salt heart-healthy diet</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Attend cardiac rehabilitation</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Regular follow-up echocardiograms</li></ol><h2>Recovery Time</h2><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Hospital stay: 4–7 days</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Light activities: 2–3 weeks</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Full recovery: 6–8 weeks</li></ol><p>Minimally invasive procedures may allow faster recovery.</p>",
                                                    "precaution": "<h2>Pre-Procedure Precautions (Pre-Care)</h2><p>Before surgery:</p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Cardiac evaluation (Echo, ECG, CT/MRI if required)</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Blood tests &amp; imaging</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Inform doctor about:</li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Diabetes</li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Kidney disease</li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Bleeding disorders</li><li data-list=\"bullet\" class=\"ql-indent-1\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Current medications</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Stop smoking</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Avoid food &amp; water 8 hours before surgery</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Arrange post-surgery home support</li></ol>",
                                                    "sideeffects": "<h2>Risks &amp; Side Effects</h2><p>Tricuspid valve repair is generally safe, but risks may include:</p><h3>Common:</h3><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Chest discomfort</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Fatigue</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Temporary irregular heartbeat</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Swelling</li></ol><h3>Rare but Serious:</h3><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Infection</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Bleeding</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Blood clots</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Stroke</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Valve leakage recurrence</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Need for future surgery</li></ol>",
